OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClouding
OL,6,Fover, with rain affecting western
OL,7,Fparts, while East Anglia is likely to
OL,8,Fremain dry. A gentle easterly breeze
OL,9,Fgradually strengthens by Tuesday
OL,10,Fmorning, especially along the coast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FCloudy start, with outbreaks
OL,13,Fof rain in western parts, drier
OL,14,Felsewhere. Rain moves in from the
OL,15,Fsouth to affect most places by late
OL,16,Fmorning, clearing later. Windy along
OL,17,Fthe coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
