OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fon Wednesday with heavy rain and
OL,7,Fpossibly some strong winds in places.
OL,8,FDrier and brighter on Thursday, with
OL,9,Flight winds. Heavy rain and strong
OL,10,Fwinds on Friday.
